SUMMARY:December ArtWalk
LOCATION:Downtown Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:ArtWalk showcases the creative side of Downtown Lafayette’s c
 ultural district. Museums\, independent galleries\, studios\, craft stores
  and art houses of Downtown all participate in the monthly showcase of Aca
 diana’s artistic talent. Those who come will leave inspired as they expl
 ore the Downtown cultural district.\n​\nArtWalk takes place every second
  Saturday of the month—rain or shine. There is no one organization respo
 nsible for planning the activities. Instead\, each museum\, gallery\, or s
 tudio hosts their own unique event\, featuring local artists and performer
 s. Follow the official ArtWalk Lafayette Facebook Page to stay informed on
  monthly events.\nBecome a Vendor\nWe are excited to be partnering with La
 fayette Arts & Fleas for our events to highlight local talent! Additionall
 y\, we are always looking to bring new artisans and vendors to Downtown fo
 r ArtWalk or other various events and activities hosted by Downtown Lafaye
 tte.\nEmail lafartsfleas@gmail.com to become a vendor for future ArtWalks.
 \n\nhttps://www.downtownlafayette.org/event/artwalk-76663
